<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico drains 524 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico drains 524 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned two auctions whereby it sought to drain 524 million pesos from the secondary market on Thursday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    324 million    7 days   21.80 pct</p>
<p>    200 million    1 day    21.19 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
